        <div class="story-box">
            <p> We made it out of my house a couple of minutes behind schedule, so <<print $ct.name>> and I had to double-time it back to the campus. Normally I would hitch a ride with <<print $ep.name>>, but she had an early morning cross country class today, so she was already on campus. Which was a good thing, since I had no idea how to explain <<print $ct.name>> to her. 
