            <p> Just before we made our way to the college campus, I had to stop by where it all started. Where I met <<print $ct.name>> and nearly died saving her. At first, I thought we passed it, but then I saw the specks of dry blood covering the dead leaves. It was so surreal, seeing an area where you almost died. You would think I would feel dread or sadness, but to me, it was the beginning of something. Something that would change my life. For the better? it was too early to answer that kind of question. 
