            <p> So from there, we began to cover up all the blood that had dried overnight. Luckily it was all on dead leaves, so all we had to do was just move them around until the blood just disappeared. Plus with the priest's body vanishing in a puff of ash, there was no dead body to bury. Everything was going until we stumbled upon something gleaming in the leaves. It was the sword I stabbed the deranged priest with, and the dagger he was about to use to kill <<print $ct.name>>. 
